#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-10.mw:1
msgid ""
"WikiToLearn is actively developed both on the technical and the content "
"side.\n"
"It's possible to contribute in several ways, regardless of the user's skills "
"and experience."
msgstr ""
"WikiToLearn desendólcase activamente nel llau téunicu y de conteníu.\n"
"Ye posible collaborar de varies formes, independientemente de la esperiencia "
"o habilidá del usuariu."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-10.mw:1
msgid "Web development"
msgstr "Desendolcu web"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-10.mw:5
msgid ""
"There are lots of web app and applications developed by WikiToLearn.\n"
"Web development is split into groups and every group has its maintainer.\n"
"Take a look at http://meta.wikitolearn.org/Tech_Team and feel free to "
"contact the members to ask them more questions."
msgstr ""
"Hai munches aplicaciones desendolcaes por WikiToLearn.\n"
"El desendolcu web dixébrase en grupos y caún tien el so caltenedor.\n"
"Écha-y un güeyu a http://meta.wikitolearn.org/Tech_Team y siéntite llibre de "
"ponete en contautu colos mimebros pa face-yos más entrugues."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-10.mw:5
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "Traducción"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-10.mw:10
msgid ""
"If you want to help with translation you can join the [https://chat."
"wikitolearn.org/channel/translation #translation] channel."
msgstr ""
"Si quies ayudar cola traducción, pues xunite a la canal [https://chat."
"wikitolearn.org/channel/translation #translation]."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-10.mw:10
msgid "Bug tracking"
msgstr "Rastrexu de fallos"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-10.mw:13
msgid ""
"We use phabricator to keep tracks of our development and our bugs.\n"
"If you think you have found a bug and want to tell us about it, you need to "
"[https://identity.kde.org/index.php?r=registration/index register to KDE "
"identity] , log in into phabricator and [https://phabricator.kde.org/"
"maniphest/task/edit/form/1/?tags=WikiToLearn create a ticket]."
msgstr ""
"Usamos Phabricator pa tener un rexistru del desendolcu y los fallos.\n"
"Si cuides qu'atopesti un fallu y quies falanos d'elli vas precisar "
"[https://identity.kde.org/index.php?r=registration/index rexistrar una "
"identidá de KDE], aniciar sesión en Phabricator y [https://phabricator.kde."
"org/maniphest/task/edit/form/1/?tags=WikiToLearn crear un informe]."
